OL,3,GNEWSACar fanatic, 10, surprised with
OL,4,Adream Reliant Robin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-year-old boy is living his very
OL,7,Fown Del Boy dream after his parents
OL,8,Fsurprised him with a 1975 Reliant Super
OL,9,FRobin.
OL,11,FToby, from west Oxfordshire, has always
OL,12,Fbeen infatuated with the iconic
OL,13,Fthree-wheeler - even making his own
OL,14,FLego model of the car.
OL,16,FAfter spotting a turquoise Reliant up
OL,17,Ffor auction earlier this year, his dad
OL,18,FSteve secretly purchased the classic
OL,19,FBritish car that was made famous by the
OL,20,FBBC sitcom Only Fools and Horses.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
